        "incapacitation"
      ],
      "text": "Each time the marut makes a fist Strike, it chooses either lightning or thunder.\n\n- If it chooses lightning, the attack deals an additional 2d12 electricity damage and the target must succeed at a DC 33 Fortitude save save or be Blinded for 1 minute.\n\n- If it chooses thunder, the attack deals an additional 3d8 sonic damage and the target must succeed at a DC 36 Fortitude save save or be Deafened for 1 minute.",
